                <pb facs="0707" n="627" xml:id="pg627"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-11"><hi rendition="#italic">August 11,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee directs Mr. Powell to disregard the blockade unless it is effective,
                    and to endeavor to protect any American, Cuban, or unprotected foreign vessels
                    desiring to enter Cape.)</p>
            </div>
